The receipt images in data/receipts/ and the expected answers in data/labels.json come from
the test split of SROIE (ICDAR 2019 Robust Reading Challenge on Scanned Receipts OCR and
Information Extraction), as published on Hugging Face by jsdnrs under CC BY 4.0:
https://huggingface.co/datasets/jsdnrs/ICDAR2019-SROIE

Huang, Z., Chen, K., He, J., Bai, X., Karatzas, D., Lu, S., Jawahar, C.V.
"ICDAR2019 Competition on Scanned Receipt OCR and Information Extraction", ICDAR 2019.

The images are resized to a long side of 1600 px and re-encoded as JPEG. No other change.
The code in this repository is Apache-2.0 (see LICENSE); the data keeps its own licence.
